    <string name="about_tagline">Typical micro-purge: ~0.006 ml vs 8–15 ml for factory deep cleanings. Reuse the same scrap sheet dozens of times.</string>
    <string name="about_wifi_bullet">• Wi-Fi Printers: Automatic mDNS discovery + direct IPP/PWG-Raster/SNMP/EWS.</string>
    <string name="about_tanks_bullet">• 4-Tank &amp; 6-Tank Photo: Supports EcoTank (ET-2810, ET-4810) and 6-Tank Photo (ET-8550, L8180).</string>
    <string name="about_usb_bullet">• USB-Only Printers (e.g. Canon G2770): Connect via the 1-Click Desktop app on Windows/macOS/Linux.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_bullet">• Privacy: Zero telemetry by default; optional anonymous Opt-In diagnostics only.</string>
    <string name="about_license">• Software License: AGPL-3.0-only • Copyright © 2026 Umberto (umbette).</string>
    <string name="about_github_btn">Source Code &amp; Guides on GitHub</string>

